<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Flour seeks 16,700 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Korea Flour seeks 16,700 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Flour Milling Corp invited on Wednesday tenders for 16,700 tonnes of U.S. wheat by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT), traders said.</p>
<p>They said shipment was set for January 20-February 20 from the Pacific Northwest to the Korean port city of Inchon.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
